            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0289" n="177" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg177"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20261/27: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-08T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 8, 1919,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>1556. Your 3699, March 5, 5 p.m.<anchor n="42" xml:id="d152-f1"/> Have Larsen use
                    every unofficial effort to secure release of Tredwell and Kalamatiano.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
